</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1170655194822">
<problem id="fs-id1170655194825">
<para id="fs-id1170655194827">નજીકના સો સુધી આશરે લખો.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170655194830"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 28,166 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 481,628</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1170655194842">
<problem id="fs-id1170655194844">
<para id="fs-id1170655194846">નજીકના દશક સુધી આશરે લખો.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170655194849"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 1,492 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 1,497</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655194853">
<para id="fs-id1170655194856"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 1,490 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 1,500</para>
