</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1170655198344">
<problem id="fs-id1170655198346">
<para id="fs-id1170655198348">619,348</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1170655198360">
<problem id="fs-id1170655198362">
<para id="fs-id1170655198364">2,586,991</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655198368">
<para id="fs-id1170655198370"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 2,587,000 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 2,587,000 <span class="token">ⓒ</span> 2,590,000</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1170655198376">
<problem id="fs-id1170655198378">
<para id="fs-id1170655198380">4,287,965</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<para id="fs-id1166419357366"><emphasis effect="bold">અવયવીઓ અને અવયવો ઓળખો</emphasis></para>
<para id="fs-id1170655198399">નીચેના અભ્યાસમાં, વિભાજ્યતાની કસોટીઓથી નક્કી કરો કે દરેક સંખ્યા 2, 3, 5, 6 અને 10 વડે વિભાજ્ય છે કે નહીં.</para>
<exercise id="fs-id1170655198403">
<problem id="fs-id1170655198405">
<para id="fs-id1170655198407">84</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655198412">
<para id="fs-id1170655198414">2, 3 અને 6 વડે વિભાજ્ય</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1170655198419">
<problem id="fs-id1170655198422">
<para id="fs-id1170655198424">9,696</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1170655198436">
<problem id="fs-id1170655198438">
<para id="fs-id1170655198440">75</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655198444">
<para id="fs-id1170655198446">3 અને 5 વડે વિભાજ્ય</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1170655198452">
<problem id="fs-id1170655198454">
<para id="fs-id1170655198456">78</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1170655198468">
<problem id="fs-id1170655198470">
<para id="fs-id1170655198472">900</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655198477">
<para id="fs-id1170655198479">2, 3, 5, 6 અને 10 વડે વિભાજ્ય</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1170655198485">
<problem id="fs-id1170655198487">
<para id="fs-id1170655198489">800</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1170655195988">
<problem id="fs-id1170655195990">
<para id="fs-id1170655195992">986</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655195996">
<para id="fs-id1170655195998">2 વડે વિભાજ્ય</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
