<problem id="fs-id1170655196055">
<para id="fs-id1170655196057">22,335</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655196062">
<para id="fs-id1170655196064">3 અને 5 વડે વિભાજ્ય</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1170655196069">
<problem id="fs-id1170655196071">
<para id="fs-id1170655196073">39,075</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<para id="fs-id1166426329770"><emphasis effect="bold">અવિભાજ્ય અવયવીકરણ અને લઘુત્તમ સામાન્ય અવયવી શોધો</emphasis></para>
<para id="fs-id1170655196091">નીચેના અભ્યાસમાં, અવિભાજ્ય અવયવીકરણ કરો.</para>
<exercise id="fs-id1170655196095">
<problem id="fs-id1170655196097">
<para id="fs-id1170655196099">86</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655196103">
<para id="fs-id1170655196105"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>43</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1170655196118">
<problem id="fs-id1170655196120">
<para id="fs-id1170655196122">78</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1170655196146">
<problem id="fs-id1170655196148">
<para id="fs-id1170655209496">132</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655209501">
<para id="fs-id1170655209503"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
